 rustClean  Disks — choose a disk to scan
────────┌ Keys ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐────────
  Name  │▶ This screen: Disk list                                                          │
▶ Macint│ ↑↓  j k       select a disk                                                      │
  Backup│ Enter  →  l   scan                                                               │able
        │ r             refresh the list                                                   │
        │ Esc           quit                                                               │
        │                                                                                  │
        │On every screen                                                                   │
        │ ?             this help                                                          │
        │ L             English ↔ Türkçe                                                   │
        │ T             theme: dark, light, color-blind                                    │
        │ q  Ctrl-C     quit                                                               │
        │                                                                                  │
        │Folder list                                                                       │
        │ ↑↓  j k       move                                                               │
        │ PgUp PgDn     page up / down                                                     │
        │ Home End  g G first / last row                                                   │
        │ Enter  →  l   open the folder                                                    │
        │ ⌫  ←  h  Esc  parent folder                                                      │
        │ s             sort: size, name, file count, date                                 │
        │ a             apparent / on-disk size                                            │
        │ t             map view                                                           │
        │ /             find by name (* and ? are wildcards)                               │
        │ i             summary of this folder                                             │
        │ m             reports menu                                                       │
        │ Space         add to / remove from the basket                                    │
────────│ S             show the basket                                                    │────────
        └───────────────────── ↑↓ PgUp PgDn: scroll · Esc / ?: close ──────────────────────┘
 ?  help   ↑↓  select   Enter  scan   r  refresh   L  Türkçe   T  theme   q  quit
